    <p>Madhubani ke sabhi 21 blocks ka digital data update kar diya gaya hai. Block-wise mukhya baatein niche di gayi hain:</p>

<div style="font-family: sans-serif; color: #333;">

    <div style="border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 8px; background: #fdfdfd;">
        <h3 style="color: #2c3e50; margin-top: 0;">1. Madhubani Sadar aur Rahika: Urban Survey Details</h3>
        <p>Madhubani shehar aur Rahika block mein residential plots ki sankhya zyada hai. Yahan **Circle Rate (MVR)** check karna anivarya hai. Naye survey mein purane **CS Khatiyan** ka milan dastawezo se kiya ja raha hai.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 8px; background: #fdfdfd;">
        <h3 style="color: #2c3e50; margin-top: 0;">2. Benipatti aur Madhwapur: Border Area Records</h3>
        <p>Benipatti block mein zameen ke vivad suljhane ke liye **Register 2** ka digital hona bahut zaroori hai. Border area hone ke karan yahan dastawezo ki sahi jaanch (Verification) survey team dwara bariki se ki jati hai.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 8px; background: #fdfdfd;">
        <h3 style="color: #2c3e50; margin-top: 0;">3. Jhanjharpur aur Phulparas: Survey and Mutation</h3>
        <p>Jhanjharpur subdivision ke blocks mein **Dakhil-Kharij (Mutation)** ke pending cases ko Parimarjan Plus ke zariye jaldi niptaya ja sakta hai. Yahan kheti ki zameen ke liye **LPC** hona zaroori hai.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 8px; background: #fdfdfd;">
        <h3 style="color: #2c3e50; margin-top: 0;">4. Jainagar aur Khajauli: Commercial Land Value</h3>
        <p>Jainagar ek vyaparik kendra hai, isliye yahan ki zameen ki **Minimum Value Register (MVR)** high hai. Registry se pehle naya survey status check karein taaki kisi fraud se bacha ja sake.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 8px; background: #fdfdfd;">
        <h3 style="color: #2c3e50; margin-top: 0;">5. Pandaul aur Sakri: Industrial & Agricultural Mix</h3>
        <p>Pandaul block mein purane sugar factory aur industrial areas ke karan zameen ke purane records (CS) ki bahut mang hai. Yahan **Vashavali (Family Tree)** ke bina naya khatiyan banna mushkil hai.</p>
    </div>

